---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Grok Build" description="What Grok Build is: harness for coding and long-running agentic work.">
  <section class="about-content">
    <p class="home-kicker" style="margin-bottom: 0.75rem;">Products</p>
    <h1 class="page-title">Grok Build</h1>
    <p class="page-subtitle muted">Harness for coding and sustained agentic workflows.</p>
    <p><strong>Grok Build</strong> is xAI's environment for coding and long-running agent-style tasks. Official Grok 4.6 materials listed Build as a primary surface. Elon Musk has stated that Grok 4.6 works best when evaluated with the Build harness.</p>
    <h2>What Grok Build is for</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Coding and engineering workflows</li>
      <li>Long-running, multi-step agentic tasks</li>
      <li>A recommended environment for serious evaluation of newer Grok models</li>
    </ul>
    <p class="muted" style="margin-top: 2rem;"><a href="/products">← All products</a></p>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>